# Patterns to ignore when building the Helm package.
# - Sensitive / local-only material is never packed into the chart.
# - Values files for environments are excluded from the packaged .tgz; only the
#   active -f values override is applied at install time.

.git
.gitignore
.idea
.vscode
*.tmproj
.tmp
# Note: Helm 4 rejects the double-star (**) wildcard. The chart contains no
# *.md files, so no recursive markdown exclusion is required. If documentation
# is later shipped, exclude markdown files explicitly by name here.
values-local.yaml
values-qa.yaml
values-uat.yaml
values-root.yaml